sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Hugs
  participant B as Bus
  participant P as Progression
  participant A as Album
  participant X as Failed-jobs sweep
  participant R as Replay (Q9)
  H->>B: hugGiven {giver, message, day, first}
  par each subscriber in its own mutation
    B->>P: pay hug XP + day bonus
    P-->>B: recorded
  and
    B->>A: earn the hug find
    A--xB: throws (a bug, or a limit)
  end
  Note over B,X: Convex retries transient errors, never a throw
  Note over P,X: the find is lost, the XP stays paid
  X->>X: every 15 min: reports it to error tracking
  R->>A: re-runs the failed subscriber with the stored event
  A->>A: earnItem keyed hug-find:day, recorded once
  Note over B,R: a replay to Progression answers already recorded
